---
import DashboardLayout from "../../../layouts/DashboardLayout.astro";
import integrationsScript from "../../../scripts/admin-integrations.ts?url";
---

<DashboardLayout
  title="Integracoes"
  subtitle="Conecte servicos externos para enriquecer produtos, classificacao e consulta fiscal"
>
  <section class="integrations-hero">
    <div>
      <span class="integrations-eyebrow">Hub de terceiros</span>
      <h2>Integre dados externos sem misturar com o motor fiscal</h2>
      <p>
        Cada conector fica isolado, com credencial propria e teste operacional. A plataforma usa
        essas fontes para enriquecer produto, GTIN, descricao e classificacao sem perder controle.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="integration-meter" aria-label="Resumo das integracoes">
      <span>Integrações iniciais</span>
      <strong>2</strong>
      <p>Cosmos para GTIN e OpenAI para classificacao assistida de produtos.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="integrations-grid">
    <div class="integration-main-stack">
    <article class="integration-card integration-card--cosmos">
      <header class="integration-card__header">
        <div class="integration-card__brand">
          <span class="integration-logo">C</span>
          <div>
            <span class="integrations-eyebrow">Produtos e GTIN</span>
            <h3>Cosmos BlueSoft</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span id="cosmos-status" class="integration-status">Carregando</span>
      </header>

      <p>
        A API Cosmos consulta produtos por codigo de barras e pode retornar descricao, NCM,
        marca, categoria e dados comerciais. Essa integracao sera usada para enriquecer a base de produtos.
      </p>

      <div class="integration-flow">
        <span>GTIN</span>
        <span>Cosmos</span>
        <span>Produto fiscal</span>
        <span>Motor tributario</span>
      </div>

      <form id="cosmos-form" class="integration-form">
        <label class="integration-switch">
          <input id="cosmos-enabled" type="checkbox" />
          <span>Ativar integracao Cosmos para esta organizacao</span>
        </label>

        <label>
          Base URL
          <input id="cosmos-base-url" type="url" value="https://api.cosmos.bluesoft.com.br" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Token da API
          <input id="cosmos-token" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Cole o token Cosmos" />
        </label>

        <label class="full-width">
          Observacoes internas
          <textarea id="cosmos-notes" rows="4" placeholder="Ex.: token da conta principal, uso para enriquecimento de produto por GTIN"></textarea>
        </label>

        <div class="integration-actions full-width">
          <button class="primary-button" type="submit">Salvar integracao</button>
          <a class="secondary-link" href="https://cosmos.bluesoft.com.br/api" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            Abrir documentacao
          </a>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="cosmos-feedback" class="integration-feedback">Carregando configuracao...</div>

      <section class="cosmos-lab">
        <div>
          <span class="integrations-eyebrow">Busca por descricao</span>
          <h4>Encontrar candidatos de produto</h4>
          <p>
            A Cosmos retorna varios candidatos. A plataforma captura descricao, GTIN, NCM e CEST,
            e usa o NCM/CEST para validar as sugestoes no motor fiscal interno.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cosmos-search-bar">
          <input id="cosmos-search-query" type="text" placeholder="Ex.: coca cola lata, cerveja skol, shampoo 350ml" />
          <button id="cosmos-search-button" class="primary-button primary-button--amber" type="button">Buscar produtos</button>
        </div>

        <div id="cosmos-search-feedback" class="integration-feedback">Aguardando busca por descricao.</div>
        <div id="cosmos-search-result"></div>
      </section>
    </article>

    <article class="integration-card integration-card--openai">
      <header class="integration-card__header">
        <div class="integration-card__brand">
          <span class="integration-logo integration-logo--openai">AI</span>
          <div>
            <span class="integrations-eyebrow">Classificacao assistida</span>
            <h3>OpenAI</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span id="openai-status" class="integration-status">Carregando</span>
      </header>

      <p>
        Use a OpenAI como camada assistiva para normalizar descricoes, sugerir categorias fiscais,
        explicar divergencias e acelerar a triagem humana sem substituir regra oficial.
      </p>

      <div class="integration-flow integration-flow--three">
        <span>Descricao</span>
        <span>IA assistiva</span>
        <span>Triagem fiscal</span>
      </div>

      <form id="openai-form" class="integration-form">
        <label class="integration-switch">
          <input id="openai-enabled" type="checkbox" />
          <span>Ativar classificacao assistida por OpenAI</span>
        </label>

        <label>
          Base URL
          <input id="openai-base-url" type="url" value="https://api.openai.com/v1" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Modelo
          <input id="openai-model" type="text" value="gpt-5.4-mini" />
        </label>

        <label>
          API key
          <input id="openai-token" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Cole a OPENAI_API_KEY" />
        </label>

        <label class="full-width">
          Observacoes internas
          <textarea id="openai-notes" rows="4" placeholder="Ex.: usar apenas para sugestao textual, nunca para aplicar regra fiscal automaticamente"></textarea>
        </label>

        <div class="integration-actions full-width">
          <button class="primary-button" type="submit">Salvar OpenAI</button>
          <a class="secondary-link" href="https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/responses" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            Docs Responses API
          </a>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="openai-feedback" class="integration-feedback">Carregando configuracao...</div>

      <section class="ai-lab">
        <div>
          <span class="integrations-eyebrow">Laboratorio fiscal</span>
          <h4>Teste de classificacao assistida</h4>
          <p>Informe um item real e veja como a IA organiza sinais para revisao humana.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="integration-form">
          <label class="full-width">
            Descricao do produto
            <input id="openai-test-description" type="text" value="HEINEKEN LN ZERO 6X330ML RV" />
          </label>

          <label>
            GTIN
            <input id="openai-test-gtin" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="7896045506057" />
          </label>

          <label>
            NCM
            <input id="openai-test-ncm" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="22029100" />
          </label>

          <label>
            CEST
            <input id="openai-test-cest" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="0302201" />
          </label>

          <label>
            UF
            <input id="openai-test-uf" type="text" maxlength="2" value="GO" />
          </label>

          <label>
            Regime
            <select id="openai-test-regime">
              <option value="simples_nacional">Simples Nacional</option>
              <option value="lucro_presumido">Lucro Presumido</option>
              <option value="lucro_real">Lucro Real</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <label>
            Operacao
            <input id="openai-test-operation" type="text" value="venda interna para consumidor final" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="integration-actions">
          <button id="openai-test-button" class="primary-button primary-button--amber" type="button">Classificar item</button>
        </div>

        <div id="openai-test-feedback" class="integration-feedback">Aguardando classificacao.</div>
        <div id="openai-test-result"></div>
      </section>
    </article>
    </div>

    <aside class="integration-side">
      <article class="integration-test-card">
        <span class="integrations-eyebrow">Teste rapido</span>
        <h3>Consultar GTIN</h3>
        <p>Use um codigo de barras real para validar token, conectividade e resposta da Cosmos.</p>

        <form id="cosmos-test-form" class="integration-form">
          <label>
            Codigo de barras
            <input id="cosmos-test-gtin" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Ex.: 7896045506057" />
          </label>

          <button class="primary-button primary-button--amber" type="submit">Testar consulta</button>
        </form>

        <div id="cosmos-test-feedback" class="integration-feedback">Aguardando teste.</div>
        <div id="cosmos-test-result"></div>
      </article>

      <article class="integration-roadmap">
        <span class="integrations-eyebrow">Proximas conexoes</span>
        <h3>Fila de integracoes</h3>
        <div class="roadmap-list">
          <span>Receita / CNPJ</span>
          <span>OpenAI / classificacao assistida</span>
          <span>SEFAZ / fontes estaduais</span>
          <span>CONFAZ / tabelas oficiais</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <script type="module" src={integrationsScript}></script>

  <style>
    .integrations-hero,
    .integrations-grid,
    .integration-card,
    .integration-main-stack,
    .integration-side,
    .integration-test-card,
    .integration-roadmap,
    .integration-form {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .integration-main-stack {
      align-content: start;
    }

    .integrations-hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(260px, 0.65fr);
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.18), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.14), transparent 26%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fbff);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);
    }

    .integrations-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.16);
      color: #92400e;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .integrations-hero h2,
    .integration-card h3,
    .integration-test-card h3,
    .integration-roadmap h3 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .integrations-hero p,
    .integration-card p,
    .integration-test-card p,
    .integration-roadmap p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #52657c;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .integration-meter {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(236, 254, 255, 0.92), rgba(255, 251, 235, 0.82));
    }

    .integration-meter span {
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .integration-meter strong {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    .integrations-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(320px, 0.75fr);
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .integration-card,
    .integration-test-card,
    .integration-roadmap {
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.88);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fbff);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    }

    .integration-card--cosmos {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.12), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fbff);
    }

    .integration-card--openai {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.14), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fbff);
    }

    .integration-card__header,
    .integration-card__brand,
    .integration-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .integration-card__brand {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .integration-logo {
      display: inline-grid;
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e, #0ea5e9);
      color: white;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 24px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.22);
    }

    .integration-logo--openai {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #0f766e);
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .integration-status {
      display: inline-flex;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: #475569;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .integration-status--ok {
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
    }

    .integration-flow {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .integration-flow--three {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .integration-flow span {
      padding: 13px 12px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(186, 200, 214, 0.72);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      color: #334155;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .integration-form {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .integration-form label {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      color: #334155;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .integration-form input,
    .integration-form select,
    .integration-form textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      background: white;
      color: #0f172a;
      font: inherit;
    }

    .ai-lab {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.24);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 251, 235, 0.78), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92));
    }

    .ai-lab h4 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .integration-switch {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      display: flex !important;
      grid-template-columns: none;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
    }

    .integration-switch input {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
    }

    .full-width {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .primary-button,
    .secondary-link {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e, #0ea5e9);
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .primary-button--amber {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #92400e, #f59e0b);
    }

    .secondary-link {
      color: #0f172a;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    }

    .integration-feedback {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #52657c;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .integration-feedback--success {
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: #166534;
    }

    .integration-feedback--error {
      background: #fff1f2;
      color: #b91c1c;
    }

    .cosmos-result-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .cosmos-result-grid span {
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: white;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .cosmos-result-grid strong {
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .cosmos-lab {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #cfe0ee;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.09), transparent 45%),
        #ffffff;
    }

    .cosmos-lab h4 {
      margin: 4px 0;
      color: #132f43;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .cosmos-lab p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #5f7187;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .cosmos-search-bar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .cosmos-search-bar input {
      min-width: 0;
      border: 1px solid #cfe0ee;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      color: #132f43;
      font-size: 15px;
      background: #f8fbff;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #d7e2ef;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: white;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table__head,
    .cosmos-search-table__row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 1.6fr) 140px 110px 110px 120px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table__head {
      background: #edf5fb;
      color: #52677d;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table__head span,
    .cosmos-search-table__row span {
      display: grid;
      align-content: center;
      gap: 4px;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      border-right: 1px solid #d7e2ef;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table__head span:last-child,
    .cosmos-search-table__row span:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table__row {
      border-top: 1px solid #d7e2ef;
      color: #274057;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table__row:nth-child(even) {
      background: #fbfdff;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table__row strong {
      overflow: hidden;
      color: #132f43;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .cosmos-search-table__row small {
      overflow: hidden;
      color: #6b7e93;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .ai-classification {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: white;
    }

    .ai-classification__head {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .ai-risk {
      display: inline-flex;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fef3c7;
      color: #92400e;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .ai-fields {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .ai-fields span {
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .ai-fields strong {
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .roadmap-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .roadmap-list span {
      padding: 13px 14px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: #fff7ed;
      color: #7c2d12;
      font-weight: 900;
      border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .integrations-hero,
      .integrations-grid,
      .integration-form,
      .integration-flow,
      .integration-flow--three,
      .ai-fields {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</DashboardLayout>
